<title>FINLAND: Cultor 1996 sales, op profit by division.</title>
<headline>Cultor 1996 sales, op profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sweeteners, feeds and bakery group Cultor Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown of net sales and operating profit by division (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES		 1996	    1995     change (pct)</p>
<p> Food Science	   2,035	     641	   +217</p>
<p> Feed Ingredients	 370	     341	     +9</p>
<p> Baking		     994	     835	    +19</p>
<p> Nutrition		4,615	   4,155	    +11</p>
<p> Others		     348	     229	    +52</p>
<p> TOTAL		    8,362	   6,201	    +35</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	1996	    1995     change (pct)</p>
<p> Food Science	     167		96	    +74</p>
<p> Feed Ingredients	  58		46	    +26</p>
<p> Baking			80		62	    +29</p>
<p> Nutrition		  288	     380	    -24</p>
<p> Others		     -48	     -56	    +14</p>
<p> TOTAL			545	     528	     +3</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
